	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas nudiustertius vesperi cum <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> senatus et <persName ref="p8018">Halleri</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nostri accepi sumque mox nescio quo terrore [vehem] enter correptus, quod viderem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p8018">Halleri</persName> opera effectum, ut senatus ad me scriberet, simul et quod illi tecum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>plura multo mihi tribuatis quam pro re, quamque ego possim agnoscere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Id quod serio (ita me Christus amet) prorsumque ex animo scribo.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Supra modum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>enim vererer, si hanc provinciam susciperem, ut expectationi, quam sustineo, responder<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>e possem; adeo nunc destitui me sentio iis rebus, quę ad dextre adminis<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>trandam tam insignem Christi ecclesiam in primis putantur necessariae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Proinde dominus vota illa tua pro me facta proximis tuis literis rata esse <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>velit, ut eam mihi mentem inspiret, quę sua spiritu illustrata confirma<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>taque ea videat et faciat, quę glorię nominis sui, suę ecclesię aedificationi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>meęque saluti vere sint commodatura.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad te nundinis proximis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName>Wilensibus</placeName> cum literis <persName>Waltero</persName> nostro ab <placeName ref="l513">Ulmis</placeName>, ex sorore nepoti <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>inscriptis; quas num acceperis, fac, ubi primum licebit, intelligam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Quid <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> a me petant, <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> noster non dubito quin ad te scripserit; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quid ego responderim, exemplum ad te nunc mitto, quod admissus error <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>fecit, ut mecum retinuerim, alioqui vix tam diligens futurus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Petit <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName>, ut vel quarto vel tertio calendas Decembris <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad se veniam, istinc deinde secum et cum legatus <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> profecturus, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quod posterius ęgre fieri ob certas caussas poterit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rogo tamen te, ut <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quamprimum istuc venerit, me conducto in hoc tabellione, si aliter <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nequeas, de suo adventu facias certiorem, quo porro, quid opus facto sit, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dispicere possim.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Cum <persName ref="p714">Curione</persName> ipse expostulabis; existimat <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>literas tuas in <persName ref="p8171">Theodori</persName> nostri ędibus relictas; verum ut nihil it aliud, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>in hoc certe valde peccavit, quod huc rediens nullas se a quoque <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>extra <persName ref="p1560">Hopperum</persName> accepisse affirmabat.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Festinat <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName>, ut illic <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName> inveniat, nec potuit tempestivius, quandoquidem <persName ref="p8018">Halleri</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>literę nudius tertius sunt vesperi allatę et <persName ref="p714">Curioni</persName> inscriptas <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ego heri ante diem <placeName ref="l50">Episcopicellam</placeName> misi, quare tu quoque videbis, ne, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quod serius adest, sibi sit fraudi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Nichts neuws, dann das die kongklichen comissarii in stäter <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>uͤbund stond, da[s] sy <placeName ref="l257">Costentz</placeName> (als sy fuͤrgebend) in ain auffnemen <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>bringind; habend vollen gwalt, alls ze handlen, und ist yetz <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>die acht allenthalb widerum uffgehept.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Unsere ustrettnen, min l[ieber] bruͦder, ouch vetter, stattsc[h]riber, zunfftmaister <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName>Labhart</persName>, zunfftmaister <persName>Bär</persName>, <persName>Ludwig Heuruß</persName>, <persName>Mattheus Flaur</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ouch noch ain ratsher, der <persName>Hubentobel</persName> genannt, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ouch <persName>Hainrich Hack</persName> von <placeName ref="l159">Frowenfeld</placeName>, fabricpfleger gewesen, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>beratschlagend yetz, wie sy fuͤr sich und die iren supplicierind, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ouch fuͤr die prediger, damitt man yederman das syn verfolgen <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>lasß etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Wirt hart erhalten werden etc. behaltends nochmals by euch.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Gott mitt euch!</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Den bittend trulich, trulich fuͤr uns.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Datum 20. Novembri<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>s.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z44"/><persName ref="p8055">A[mbrosius] Bl[aurerus</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, amico et fratri <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>colendo ac modis omnibus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>charissimo.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
